WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.060 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 6=

5
01:56.500 --> 01:57.020
What?

6
01:57.260 --> 01:58.580
Does my chair bite?

7
01:59.100 --> 01:59.980
Why are you just standing there?

8
02:01.180 --> 02:01.460
Your...

9
02:02.100 --> 02:02.820
Your Highness.

10
02:08.260 --> 02:11.140
How's that immortality elixir

11
02:11.900 --> 02:12.420
I asked you to make?

12
02:14.140 --> 02:14.580
Your Highness,

13
02:15.060 --> 02:15.340
I...

14
02:16.340 --> 02:17.340
I can't make an elixir of immortality.

15
02:23.380 --> 02:24.380
You can't?

16
02:27.940 --> 02:28.700
So...

17
02:29.660 --> 02:31.820
you don't want to be my consort?

18
02:45.220 --> 02:46.700
All right, I'm just teasing you.

19
02:47.220 --> 02:48.100
I have nothing else planned tonight.

20
02:48.340 --> 02:49.260
I want to play backgammon with you.

21
03:00.660 --> 03:02.180
What do you think

22
03:02.780 --> 03:03.500
of that Yan Shang

23
03:04.460 --> 03:05.300
you were with today?

24
03:06.500 --> 03:06.980
Yan Shang?

25
03:08.380 --> 03:08.980
He's a good man.

26
03:10.020 --> 03:10.740
He's kind, too.

27
03:11.580 --> 03:12.380
He's always so nice to everyone.

28
03:13.380 --> 03:15.780
Lucky you never ran into bad people,

29
03:16.500 --> 03:18.420
or there'd be nothing left of you.

30
03:28.620 --> 03:29.700
What's got you so torn?

31
03:33.460 --> 03:33.940
Your Highness,

32
03:35.500 --> 03:36.100
today,

33
03:36.940 --> 03:38.340
besides Yan Shang and me,

34
03:39.220 --> 03:40.140
there was another friend.

35
03:46.660 --> 03:47.340
And?

36
03:49.820 --> 03:50.380
His name is...

37
03:51.220 --> 03:52.020
Feng Xianyu.

38
03:52.540 --> 03:53.380
He's very talented.

39
03:53.980 --> 03:54.740
- He said... - So...

40
03:55.100 --> 03:56.460
this Mr. Feng

41
03:57.460 --> 03:58.700
sent you to me

42
03:59.660 --> 04:00.460
to recommend him?

43
04:04.860 --> 04:06.140
Look at you, Wei Shu.

44
04:07.020 --> 04:08.300
Li Zhi says you're clever,

45
04:09.100 --> 04:11.660
but you're a real fool, aren't you?

46
04:13.580 --> 04:16.020
Whenever you do something against your conscience,

47
04:16.140 --> 04:17.460
you can barely get the words out.

48
04:18.460 --> 04:20.260
So why did you agree to it?

49
04:21.060 --> 04:21.580
Your Highness...

50
04:22.380 --> 04:23.340
Don't you realize

51
04:23.700 --> 04:24.860
you're both taking the imperial exams?

52
04:25.180 --> 04:26.380
You'll be competing against each other.

53
04:27.460 --> 04:27.860
Yes.

54
04:28.540 --> 04:30.860
You recommended him to me today.

55
04:31.460 --> 04:32.260
What about you?

56
04:33.620 --> 04:35.820
What if I took a fancy to him

57
04:36.260 --> 04:36.900
and

58
04:37.420 --> 04:38.220
recommended him

59
04:38.580 --> 04:39.420
instead of you?

60
04:40.060 --> 04:41.060
What would you do then?

61
04:45.780 --> 04:46.220
Your Highness,

62
04:47.100 --> 04:47.580
I'm sorry.

63
04:48.980 --> 04:49.580
You're right.

64
04:50.580 --> 04:51.460
If I can't bring myself

65
04:51.900 --> 04:52.700
to go against my conscience,

66
04:53.220 --> 04:54.180
I shouldn't have agreed.

67
04:54.500 --> 04:55.660
My mentor gave me an order,

68
04:56.500 --> 04:57.340
but I simply can't carry it out.

69
05:01.460 --> 05:02.140
I'm returning

70
05:03.140 --> 05:03.900
this cloak to you.

71
05:05.020 --> 05:06.340
Tomorrow, I'll ask the Director

72
05:06.780 --> 05:07.700
to expel me.

73
05:11.580 --> 05:12.900
Aren't you afraid

74
05:14.220 --> 05:15.220
Li Zhi will punish you?

75
05:18.660 --> 05:19.940
I'll apologize to my mentor.

76
05:21.100 --> 05:22.140
Your Highness, punish me as well.

77
05:24.420 --> 05:24.980
Wei Shu,

78
05:25.580 --> 05:26.660
you're quite adorable.

79
05:28.980 --> 05:29.740
Sit down. Relax.

80
05:30.540 --> 05:31.620
I have real business to discuss with you.

81
05:34.060 --> 05:34.540
Your Highness...

82
05:34.860 --> 05:35.340
Sit.

83
05:37.820 --> 05:38.180
Yes.

84
05:46.660 --> 05:47.100
Wei Shu,

85
05:48.020 --> 05:48.660
listen carefully.

86
05:49.300 --> 05:50.700
Your mentor is my uncle.

87
05:51.700 --> 05:53.940
You know family orders carry equal weight.

88
05:54.740 --> 05:55.460
I'm just as trapped

89
05:55.780 --> 05:56.700
by his plans as you are.

90
05:57.180 --> 05:57.580
But I...

91
05:57.620 --> 05:58.900
Let me finish.

92
05:59.940 --> 06:00.420
Today,

93
06:01.100 --> 06:02.620
I'd like us to make a pact.

94
06:03.500 --> 06:04.340
We'll work together.

95
06:04.980 --> 06:06.660
Until your imperial exams,

96
06:07.220 --> 06:08.380
we'll play along

97
06:08.820 --> 06:09.900
to keep your mentor happy.

98
06:10.940 --> 06:12.780
Just focus on your studies.

99
06:13.820 --> 06:14.780
And don't worry

100
06:15.020 --> 06:16.580
about the Wei family giving you trouble.

101
06:17.380 --> 06:18.140
From now on,

102
06:18.820 --> 06:21.180
I'll protect you.

103
06:23.140 --> 06:24.020
You like making elixirs, don't you?

104
06:25.940 --> 06:27.300
Then I'll set aside

105
06:27.500 --> 06:28.500
a spare room for you here.

106
06:29.300 --> 06:31.580
I'll get you everything you need for that.

107
06:32.180 --> 06:34.060
You can do as you please.

108
06:35.340 --> 06:35.780
Really?

109
06:37.140 --> 06:38.260
Don't get too excited just yet.

110
06:39.700 --> 06:41.380
If you really want to thank me,

111
06:41.980 --> 06:44.060
make me a few more elixirs.

112
06:45.300 --> 06:45.820
Your Highness...

113
06:46.580 --> 06:47.460
There's no rush.

114
06:47.780 --> 06:48.580
Take your time.

115
06:49.780 --> 06:50.900
Once you've made them,

116
06:51.220 --> 06:53.260
I'll let you leave the residence.

117
06:58.660 --> 06:59.140
Your Highness,

118
07:00.540 --> 07:01.700
why are you helping me?

119
07:03.700 --> 07:04.740
Because I admire you.

120
07:06.660 --> 07:07.540
I admire you

121
07:08.100 --> 07:09.100
for who you are.

122
07:10.220 --> 07:11.140
Not for your family,

123
07:11.740 --> 07:12.580
not for my uncle,

124
07:13.300 --> 07:15.380
and certainly not because you're someone's pawn.

125
07:23.820 --> 07:25.300
Why are you bowing again?

126
07:26.380 --> 07:26.820
Your Highness,

127
07:28.100 --> 07:29.940
I misjudged you before.

128
07:30.740 --> 07:31.540
I owe you an apology.

129
07:33.540 --> 07:35.420
Don't be so quick to apologize.

130
07:35.980 --> 07:36.780
What if

131
07:37.180 --> 07:38.260
you were right?

132
07:51.020 --> 07:51.940
How's my embroidery?

133
07:54.860 --> 07:56.500
Your embroidery

134
07:57.140 --> 07:57.980
still needs work.

135
08:02.580 --> 08:03.820
You should get some rest, Your Highness.

136
08:07.620 --> 08:08.100
Listen.

137
08:10.540 --> 08:11.660
The wind's picked up tonight.

138
08:13.460 --> 08:15.100
The roses outside are just blooming.

139
08:15.900 --> 08:17.140
How many will be blown away?

140
08:19.140 --> 08:19.860
I can't sleep.

141
08:20.580 --> 08:21.620
Warm me a pot of wine.

142
08:25.260 --> 08:27.620
You slept like a log in Lingnan.

143
08:28.180 --> 08:29.940
Why are you back to your old ways?

144
08:30.580 --> 08:31.740
Now that you mention it,

145
08:32.500 --> 08:33.380
you're right.

146
08:35.580 --> 08:36.980
Those days in Lingnan,

147
08:37.700 --> 08:40.180
Yan Shang kept me company every night,

148
08:41.460 --> 08:43.460
telling me all kinds of wild tales.

149
08:43.740 --> 08:45.900
Yan Shang's in Sheng'an now, anyway.

150
08:46.420 --> 08:47.460
Why not summon him

151
08:47.580 --> 08:48.940
to keep you company at bedtime?

152
08:49.380 --> 08:50.300
Why would I summon him?

153
08:51.140 --> 08:52.180
Why not call Wei Shu instead?

154
08:54.060 --> 08:55.500
I'll go fetch Mr. Wei, then.

155
08:55.740 --> 08:56.340
Come back!

156
08:57.580 --> 08:58.660
He's such a blockhead.

157
08:59.220 --> 08:59.980
If you call him over,

158
09:00.300 --> 09:01.700
he'll just blink at me

159
09:02.300 --> 09:03.380
and barely say a word.

160
09:03.660 --> 09:05.380
So Yan Shang's the better choice.

161
09:08.500 --> 09:09.140
I'm going to bed.

162
09:09.660 --> 09:10.300
You should get some sleep, too.

163
09:10.980 --> 09:11.940
Stop nagging me.

164
09:22.500 --> 09:23.460
Keep this up,

165
09:23.980 --> 09:25.260
and you'll wear yourself out.

166
09:43.140 --> 09:47.140
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft and sweet♪

167
09:47.140 --> 09:51.540
♪Fireflies dance freely through the night♪

168
09:51.740 --> 09:55.800
♪Chasing the beauty of this fleeting world♪

169
09:55.800 --> 09:59.900
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

170
10:00.100 --> 10:04.020
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

171
10:04.020 --> 10:08.420
♪Their songs linger through the passing years♪

172
10:08.700 --> 10:12.710
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

173
10:12.710 --> 10:16.500
♪How lucky I am to walk this path with you♪

174
10:17.340 --> 10:21.610
♪Playing out life's game, forever by your side♪

175
10:21.610 --> 10:25.500
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

176
10:25.900 --> 10:29.980
♪I wish time could stand still♪

177
10:29.980 --> 10:33.860
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

178
10:34.380 --> 10:37.970
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade♪

179
10:37.970 --> 10:42.180
♪Weathering life's rise and fall♪

180
10:42.820 --> 10:46.570
♪Where endless time comes to an end♪

181
10:46.570 --> 10:50.940
♪Moonlight and breeze fill our boat home♪

182
10:51.660 --> 10:54.890
♪Golden winds and jade dew return♪ (At dusk...)

183
10:54.890 --> 11:00.020
♪The world still blooms as before♪ (At dusk...)

184
11:00.140 --> 11:03.400
♪How lucky to roam with you♪ (At dusk, a small boat rocks)

185
11:03.400 --> 11:08.340
♪Back to the road where it all began♪ (At dusk, a small boat rocks)

186
11:08.540 --> 11:12.700
♪As if our youthful hearts remain♪

187
11:12.860 --> 11:14.540
♪As if our love will never fade♪ (At dusk, a small boat rocks)

188
11:14.540 --> 11:15.220
(Your name)

189
11:16.700 --> 11:17.580
(doesn't just mean)

190
11:18.860 --> 11:19.940
("a dusk-bound journey)

191
11:21.220 --> 11:22.580
(through wind and rain.")

192
11:33.540 --> 11:35.260
(Lodge of Wisdom)

193
11:36.500 --> 11:36.940
Wenji,

194
11:37.580 --> 11:38.940
I'm going to the West Market for ink.

195
11:39.460 --> 11:40.780
Are you running low on ink sticks, too?

196
11:40.980 --> 11:44.300
(Bamboo Dew)

197
11:44.300 --> 11:44.620
Wenji?

198
11:46.340 --> 11:46.620
Wenji?

199
11:48.660 --> 11:49.340
W-What's wrong?

200
11:50.180 --> 11:50.460
You...

201
11:51.140 --> 11:52.180
Is something bothering you?

202
11:52.900 --> 11:53.540
Ever since we settled here,

203
11:54.100 --> 11:55.340
you've seemed distracted.

204
11:56.260 --> 11:57.180
N-No, nothing.

205
11:57.700 --> 11:58.020
I...

206
11:58.980 --> 11:59.900
(Lodge of Wisdom) The imperial exams are near.

207
12:00.460 --> 12:02.300
Nothing matters but studying.

208
12:13.140 --> 12:13.460
(No, this won't do.)

209
12:14.380 --> 12:15.500
(I still have to see her.)

210
12:16.220 --> 12:16.620
(Otherwise,)

211
12:17.260 --> 12:18.380
(how can I study in peace?)

212
12:32.460 --> 12:32.740
Yan Shang.

213
12:34.060 --> 12:34.500
Tell me,

214
12:34.940 --> 12:36.660
which outfit suits me better?

215
12:37.700 --> 12:38.460
What about this yellow one?

216
12:40.140 --> 12:40.500
This one.

217
12:42.100 --> 12:42.420
Which one?

218
12:44.260 --> 12:44.740
This one, I guess.

219
12:45.660 --> 12:45.980
This one?

220
12:47.500 --> 12:50.700
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

221
13:01.660 --> 13:02.700
(Liu Wenji...)

222
13:03.500 --> 13:04.460
(What are you doing?)

223
13:06.340 --> 13:08.220
(Princess Danyang's Residence) (She's the princess's personal maid.)

224
13:09.100 --> 13:09.660
(Today,)

225
13:10.140 --> 13:11.300
(she might not even go out.)

226
13:15.940 --> 13:16.580
Liu Wenji!

227
13:19.260 --> 13:20.220
You've come to Sheng'an, too!

228
13:36.020 --> 13:37.060
Why so quiet?

229
13:40.980 --> 13:41.500
Seeing you...

230
13:42.460 --> 13:43.220
makes me so happy.

231
13:46.620 --> 13:47.180
Were you

232
13:47.820 --> 13:49.860
just passing by here?

233
13:52.420 --> 13:53.220
Yes, just passing by.

234
13:53.820 --> 13:54.540
I just happened to...

235
13:55.020 --> 13:55.700
run into you.

236
13:58.740 --> 13:59.780
Sheng'an is such a big place,

237
14:00.340 --> 14:01.060
with so many people.

238
14:02.380 --> 14:03.340
To run into you again,

239
14:03.580 --> 14:04.460
it must be fate!

240
14:09.300 --> 14:10.100
Where are you headed?

241
14:11.620 --> 14:12.300
Back to my lodgings.

242
14:12.740 --> 14:13.300
Where are you staying?

243
14:13.460 --> 14:14.380
I'll visit sometime.

244
14:14.940 --> 14:16.260
I've been staying with Yan Shang

245
14:16.260 --> 14:17.500
in a meditation room at Yongshou Temple.

246
14:17.860 --> 14:20.140
You're staying with Yan Shang at Yongshou Temple?

247
14:22.820 --> 14:24.020
Come on. I'll go there with you.

248
14:25.820 --> 14:26.460
That won't do!

249
14:27.140 --> 14:27.940
Why not?

250
14:31.380 --> 14:31.820
Well...

251
14:33.380 --> 14:33.900
We...

252
14:34.340 --> 14:35.860
don't have our parents' approval

253
14:37.380 --> 14:38.140
or a matchmaker's blessing yet.

254
14:38.700 --> 14:39.580
How could we...

255
14:41.100 --> 14:42.860
Liu Wenji, what are you thinking?

256
14:44.980 --> 14:46.460
I'm going to see Yan Shang.

257
14:46.860 --> 14:47.900
I need to ask him a favor.

258
14:49.820 --> 14:50.820
Y-Yan Shang?

259
15:01.180 --> 15:01.500
Well...

260
15:02.420 --> 15:02.980
Then let's go.

261
15:03.260 --> 15:03.540
Let's go!

262
15:06.780 --> 15:07.540
Oh, I almost forgot my horse.

263
15:21.180 --> 15:22.660
Your Royal Highness, the tea is ready.

264
15:45.500 --> 15:45.940
Your Royal Highness.

265
15:47.660 --> 15:48.940
(Yang Si, third son of noble Yangs) I've come all this way.

266
15:49.140 --> 15:50.340
Can't I catch my breath?

267
15:51.180 --> 15:52.020
We've barely traded a few moves,

268
15:52.500 --> 15:53.300
and you already need a rest?

269
15:55.500 --> 15:58.020
(Chongli Hall)

270
16:02.860 --> 16:05.100
(Lingbai Pavilion)

271
16:05.100 --> 16:07.780
(Chongli Hall)

272
16:11.900 --> 16:13.060
This tea was prepared for His Royal Highness.

273
16:13.820 --> 16:14.140
No matter.

274
16:14.780 --> 16:16.180
Pour him another cup.

275
16:18.740 --> 16:19.260
Thank you.

276
16:31.300 --> 16:31.660
Well?

277
16:33.180 --> 16:34.500
Your tea is still the best.

278
16:35.060 --> 16:35.620
Mr. Yang,

279
16:36.380 --> 16:37.860
that's a Yue ware cup reserved for His Royal Highness.

280
16:38.220 --> 16:39.180
(Lingbai Pavilion) The tea's Mengding tea.

281
16:39.660 --> 16:40.740
And you gulp it down like a horse!

282
16:40.860 --> 16:42.620
How'd you know I learned it from horses?

283
16:43.460 --> 16:45.140
It's a quick way to kill your thirst.

284
16:45.900 --> 16:47.140
Your Royal Highness, you have no idea.

285
16:47.340 --> 16:48.420
I've been on the road for days.

286
16:48.860 --> 16:50.420
You've had a rough journey.

287
16:52.820 --> 16:54.780
Your Royal Highness, why did you summon me back

288
16:55.380 --> 16:55.780
in such a hurry?

289
16:56.900 --> 16:57.300
Come in.

290
16:58.020 --> 16:58.660
Mind the step.

291
17:05.820 --> 17:06.700
We haven't tidied up in days,

292
17:07.260 --> 17:07.900
so it's a bit of a mess.

293
17:13.140 --> 17:13.780
Where's Yan Shang?

294
17:15.180 --> 17:16.340
The Imperial Academy let out early today.

295
17:16.780 --> 17:17.620
He was still there when I left.

296
17:17.900 --> 17:19.260
He may have gone out by now.

297
17:24.820 --> 17:25.420
Have a seat.

298
17:25.660 --> 17:26.820
I-I'll get you some tea.

299
17:38.380 --> 17:40.140
(Confucius said...)

300
18:08.220 --> 18:09.500
Wasn't that tea for me?

301
18:13.460 --> 18:13.860
The tea...

302
18:17.740 --> 18:18.060
Here.

303
18:28.140 --> 18:28.900
Careful, it's hot.

304
18:39.700 --> 18:40.660
Funny how fate works.

305
18:41.060 --> 18:42.100
I hadn't left home in days,

306
18:42.500 --> 18:43.540
but the one time I went out today,

307
18:43.660 --> 18:44.660
I happened to run into you.

308
18:47.020 --> 18:47.780
I...

309
18:48.420 --> 18:49.540
I've been in Sheng'an for days.

310
18:51.660 --> 18:52.580
I've wanted to see you.

311
18:53.860 --> 18:54.580
It's just...

312
18:57.060 --> 18:57.620
Just what?

313
19:00.260 --> 19:01.500
The princess's residence is heavily guarded,

314
19:01.700 --> 19:02.820
and I have no official title.

315
19:03.420 --> 19:04.580
Besides, you have to serve the princess.

316
19:06.540 --> 19:07.300
What's so difficult about that?

317
19:07.820 --> 19:09.260
I can come see you, too.

318
19:14.100 --> 19:15.380
You have so many books here.

319
19:19.580 --> 19:20.340
The exams are coming up.

320
19:21.140 --> 19:21.660
I should...

321
19:23.620 --> 19:24.900
I should focus on my studies.

322
19:29.980 --> 19:32.780
So you came to the capital for the exams.

323
19:33.660 --> 19:36.740
Didn't you come top in the prefectural exams?

324
19:38.180 --> 19:38.980
It was nothing.

325
19:40.740 --> 19:42.780
I'm not as impressive as you think.

326
19:43.500 --> 19:44.820
Sheng'an is full of talented scholars.

327
19:45.260 --> 19:46.300
My father always warned me

328
19:47.060 --> 19:48.620
not to grow proud or arrogant.

329
19:54.820 --> 19:55.780
Studying is hard enough.

330
19:56.100 --> 19:57.020
You came first.

331
19:57.300 --> 19:58.460
You deserve praise.

332
19:58.780 --> 19:59.700
You've earned it.

333
20:04.340 --> 20:04.740
Chunhua,

334
20:06.180 --> 20:07.340
you're the first person

335
20:08.540 --> 20:09.580
to ever tell me that.

336
20:12.820 --> 20:13.260
Thank you.

337
20:14.220 --> 20:14.660
You're welcome.

338
20:27.540 --> 20:27.980
Chunhua,

339
20:28.900 --> 20:29.460
why do you

340
20:30.420 --> 20:31.660
want to see Yan Shang?

341
20:34.780 --> 20:37.020
Actually, I'm not the one who wants to see him.

342
20:37.460 --> 20:38.580
It's the princess.

343
20:40.180 --> 20:40.500
No, that's not right.

344
20:41.300 --> 20:43.620
I'm looking for Yan Shang on the princess's behalf.

345
20:46.340 --> 20:47.060
When he gets back,

346
20:47.340 --> 20:48.420
could you tell him

347
20:48.580 --> 20:49.740
to come to the princess's residence?

348
20:49.820 --> 20:50.700
I need to ask him a favor.

349
20:51.940 --> 20:52.300
All right.

350
20:52.900 --> 20:53.220
I'll tell him.

351
20:54.260 --> 20:54.740
Thank you.

352
20:56.220 --> 20:57.460
I still have things to buy for the princess,

353
20:57.580 --> 20:58.100
so I'd better go.

354
20:58.220 --> 20:58.940
I won't keep you from studying.

355
21:08.180 --> 21:08.860
Oh, Wenji...

356
21:09.260 --> 21:10.140
Why did you want to see me?

357
21:10.660 --> 21:10.940
I...

358
21:13.580 --> 21:14.460
Never mind. I'd better go.

359
21:14.620 --> 21:15.340
I'll visit when I have time.

360
21:24.420 --> 21:24.860
Chunhua!

361
21:25.300 --> 21:25.740
Chunhua!

362
21:29.060 --> 21:29.500
What's wrong?

363
21:30.260 --> 21:31.140
Did I leave anything behind?

364
21:34.020 --> 21:34.500
Chunhua,

365
21:35.580 --> 21:36.460
on the tenth of the third month,

366
21:37.060 --> 21:38.220
there'll be a peony festival in Jinchang Ward.

367
21:38.820 --> 21:39.460
It's quite a spectacle.

368
21:40.300 --> 21:41.260
Let's go together.

369
21:45.500 --> 21:46.220
Is that an invitation?

370
21:48.620 --> 21:49.020
Yes.

371
21:50.780 --> 21:52.220
No one's ever invited me before.

372
21:52.660 --> 21:54.700
People used to invite the princess.

373
21:55.020 --> 21:55.260
I...

374
21:55.260 --> 21:55.860
I'm inviting you, and only you!

375
22:09.540 --> 22:10.020
I'd love to.

376
22:10.780 --> 22:11.500
I'll be there for sure.

377
22:35.740 --> 22:36.860
(To My Esteemed Father:)

378
22:38.540 --> 22:40.820
(I've been in the capital for several days.)

379
22:41.860 --> 22:43.060
(I'll heed your teachings)

380
22:43.940 --> 22:45.220
(and never forget my duty)

381
22:46.100 --> 22:47.740
(to bring honor to our family.)

382
23:04.420 --> 23:08.700
(to bring honor to our family.)

383
23:17.700 --> 23:19.170
("To My Esteemed Father...)

384
23:19.170 --> 23:20.740
(... to bring honor to our family.")

385
23:34.580 --> 23:34.980
Wenji,

386
23:35.780 --> 23:36.780
I've bought new ink and brushes.

387
23:37.300 --> 23:37.620
Yan Shang.

388
23:39.420 --> 23:40.380
Leave those for now.

389
23:40.620 --> 23:41.740
Chunhua told me

390
23:41.900 --> 23:43.700
she wants you at the princess's residence

391
23:44.100 --> 23:45.100
for a favor.

392
23:55.500 --> 23:56.060
What's this?

393
23:57.580 --> 23:58.380
A peace offering.

394
24:00.380 --> 24:02.980
(Qingfeng Pavilion)

395
24:27.460 --> 24:27.940
Yang Si!

396
24:29.260 --> 24:29.900
Get out here!

397
24:35.140 --> 24:35.460
Wanyao!

398
24:38.220 --> 24:39.020
What brings you back?

399
24:40.860 --> 24:41.700
Things have been quiet at the border,

400
24:42.300 --> 24:43.180
so I left the army and came home.

401
24:45.340 --> 24:46.140
It's been three years.

402
24:47.100 --> 24:48.140
I've just returned from North Jing, too.

403
24:54.020 --> 24:54.340
Here.

404
24:59.620 --> 25:00.420
After all this time,

405
25:01.020 --> 25:02.260
you greet me with a bag of fruit?

406
25:02.940 --> 25:04.260
These aren't ordinary fruits.

407
25:05.140 --> 25:05.660
They're

408
25:06.260 --> 25:07.060
tribute fruits.

409
25:09.060 --> 25:10.020
You got them from the Crown Prince?

410
25:14.060 --> 25:15.820
You know how hard life is in the army.

411
25:16.340 --> 25:17.980
My pay barely covers my wine.

412
25:18.500 --> 25:21.740
So I swiped some fruit to make do.

413
25:22.660 --> 25:22.940
No, I mean,

414
25:23.460 --> 25:24.100
as a gift for you.

415
25:25.420 --> 25:27.220
Some big name in Sheng'an you are!

416
25:27.780 --> 25:28.700
If you can't afford wine,

417
25:28.780 --> 25:29.740
go charm some people for money.

418
25:30.140 --> 25:31.540
Plenty of young ladies in Sheng'an

419
25:32.020 --> 25:33.500
would gladly buy you wine.

420
25:34.140 --> 25:34.540
Wanyao.

421
25:35.020 --> 25:35.980
What are you implying?

422
25:36.620 --> 25:37.340
Are you jealous?

423
25:43.380 --> 25:43.780
Tell me,

424
25:44.700 --> 25:45.620
why did the Crown Prince

425
25:46.100 --> 25:46.660
send you here?

426
25:55.260 --> 25:56.300
(Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!)

427
26:12.660 --> 26:13.060
Yan Shang.

428
26:43.020 --> 26:43.460
(Yan Shang!)

429
26:44.020 --> 26:44.420
(Come on!)

430
26:49.740 --> 26:50.100
Wanyao,

431
26:50.820 --> 26:52.060
you know I always speak my mind.

432
26:53.300 --> 26:53.780
Lately,

433
26:54.620 --> 26:56.780
Yu Cheng'an has been acting like he owns the court.

434
26:58.020 --> 26:58.300
And...

435
26:59.100 --> 27:00.620
you bear that ominous prophecy.

436
27:01.740 --> 27:02.580
Have you ever thought

437
27:02.780 --> 27:03.740
that with one word from him,

438
27:04.700 --> 27:06.780
you could be sent back to North Jing,

439
27:07.700 --> 27:08.140
or

440
27:08.860 --> 27:10.020
married off to someone else?

441
27:10.260 --> 27:10.980
So?

442
27:13.900 --> 27:14.420
I'll

443
27:15.340 --> 27:16.100
make a sacrifice

444
27:17.340 --> 27:17.820
and marry you.

445
27:18.820 --> 27:19.180
What do you say?

446
27:19.620 --> 27:20.220
No way.

447
27:22.500 --> 27:23.420
Why would you marry me?

448
27:25.020 --> 27:25.780
Because you like me?

449
27:33.380 --> 27:34.620
Whether I like you or not...

450
27:34.620 --> 27:35.900
w-what does that matter?

451
27:36.300 --> 27:37.060
We grew up together.

452
27:37.060 --> 27:38.020
Why bring that up now?

453
27:38.820 --> 27:39.940
I can't just leave you to fend for yourself.

454
27:40.100 --> 27:40.820
Then don't bring it up.

455
27:41.860 --> 27:43.180
Even if it's just a marriage of convenience?

456
27:45.380 --> 27:46.140
Wanyao!

457
27:47.020 --> 27:47.460
One more thing.

458
27:48.620 --> 27:49.460
I'm all grown up now.

459
27:50.420 --> 27:51.420
Stop treating me like a child.

460
27:53.020 --> 27:54.460
Your Highness, look who's here!

461
28:06.380 --> 28:06.780
Your Highness.

462
28:07.460 --> 28:08.100
I've come at a bad time.

463
28:08.780 --> 28:09.580
You certainly have.

464
28:12.300 --> 28:13.020
Why are you here?

465
28:13.620 --> 28:14.500
To thank me for getting you

466
28:15.020 --> 28:16.100
into the Imperial Academy?

467
28:27.980 --> 28:29.740
Is this the guy your uncle picked for you?

468
28:31.740 --> 28:32.420
What was his name again?

469
28:32.820 --> 28:33.300
Wei Shu?

470
28:33.740 --> 28:34.180
Shut up!

471
28:35.540 --> 28:36.140
Look at you.

472
28:37.860 --> 28:39.100
You're from a noble family,

473
28:41.060 --> 28:42.900
yet you're practically begging to be a male favorite.

474
28:44.180 --> 28:45.980
You think a pretty face lets you get away with anything?

475
28:46.540 --> 28:47.660
And you call yourself educated?

476
28:47.820 --> 28:48.340
Yang Si!

477
28:50.700 --> 28:52.060
Wanyao, you're shouting at me!

478
28:52.540 --> 28:54.020
Over some outsider, no less!

479
28:54.420 --> 28:55.820
Weren't you trying to provoke me, too?

480
28:57.260 --> 28:58.540
That's different!

481
28:59.340 --> 29:00.620
I'm worried he'll deceive you.

482
29:01.260 --> 29:02.220
And now you're taking his side!

483
29:02.460 --> 29:03.260
You're even defending him!

484
29:04.140 --> 29:05.580
Mu Wanyao, you've changed.

485
29:05.580 --> 29:06.660
You've forgotten all about loyalty!

486
29:06.820 --> 29:07.420
Get lost!

487
29:08.100 --> 29:09.540
How old are you? Aren't you tired of this?

488
29:14.740 --> 29:15.140
And you?

489
29:17.300 --> 29:18.460
What exactly are you here for?

490
29:21.300 --> 29:22.540
Your Highness is right.

491
29:23.380 --> 29:24.380
I came to thank you.

492
29:25.020 --> 29:25.580
That's all?

493
29:26.860 --> 29:28.820
A measly "thank you"? What good is that?

494
29:34.100 --> 29:34.980
Is this your token of gratitude?

495
29:38.220 --> 29:38.660
Hand it over.

496
29:40.700 --> 29:42.380
A thank-you gift? Let me see!

497
29:46.900 --> 29:48.260
You're awfully protective of it.

498
29:49.660 --> 29:50.780
I'll bet that box holds

499
29:51.220 --> 29:53.340
some lousy calligraphy or painting.

500
29:53.740 --> 29:54.500
What's so precious about that?

501
29:55.700 --> 29:58.340
Is it a painting by Gu Daozhi or calligraphy by Liu Yici?

502
29:58.340 --> 29:59.420
That's none of your business.

503
30:10.580 --> 30:11.020
Give it to me.

504
30:19.220 --> 30:19.940
There's been a misunderstanding.

505
30:20.780 --> 30:21.220
This painting

506
30:21.860 --> 30:22.780
was a gift from a friend.

507
30:23.780 --> 30:25.220
It's not my thank-you gift to Your Highness.

508
30:25.540 --> 30:26.140
Yan Shang!

509
30:27.060 --> 30:27.660
You tricked me!

510
30:28.660 --> 30:29.100
Your Highness,

511
30:29.780 --> 30:30.820
I'm not from a noble family.

512
30:31.380 --> 30:33.020
My family has no wealth, and I own little of value.

513
30:33.460 --> 30:34.340
I truly have nothing to repay you with.

514
30:35.500 --> 30:35.820
However,

515
30:36.420 --> 30:37.540
if there's anything you want,

516
30:37.900 --> 30:39.420
that I can afford or do,

517
30:40.260 --> 30:41.700
I'll gladly do it for you.

518
30:42.020 --> 30:42.460
No need.

519
30:43.260 --> 30:44.620
I want nothing from you.

520
30:45.020 --> 30:45.340
Get out!

521
30:50.540 --> 30:50.980
In that case,

522
30:52.060 --> 30:52.860
I'll take my leave.

523
31:01.940 --> 31:03.420
Isn't he from the noble Wei family?

524
31:04.100 --> 31:05.260
How come he said he's not nobility?

525
31:05.740 --> 31:06.540
Why do you care?

526
31:07.300 --> 31:07.820
You get out, too!

527
31:08.300 --> 31:09.540
Stop annoying me here!

528
31:10.140 --> 31:10.420
Get out!

529
31:18.820 --> 31:19.220
Wanyao.

530
31:20.180 --> 31:20.660
Well...

531
31:20.940 --> 31:22.980
I'll let this slide.

532
31:23.260 --> 31:24.180
I'll come see you another day.

533
31:31.060 --> 31:31.820
Yang Si,

534
31:32.660 --> 31:33.820
you're despicable.

535
31:34.940 --> 31:36.860
You know perfectly well she's being used.

536
31:37.580 --> 31:38.060
(Yang Si,)

537
31:38.900 --> 31:40.020
(if Danyang could marry you,)

538
31:40.740 --> 31:41.780
(I'd feel at ease about her.)

539
31:42.620 --> 31:43.420
(You're all I have.)

540
32:10.340 --> 32:14.860
(At dusk, a small boat rocks)

541
32:38.820 --> 32:42.700
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)

542
32:42.820 --> 32:43.260
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

543
32:43.500 --> 32:43.860
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

544
32:46.220 --> 32:47.020
(Mr. Li! Over here!)

545
32:47.260 --> 32:47.580
(This way!)

546
32:47.820 --> 32:48.100
(Here!)

547
32:48.460 --> 32:48.820
(Catch!)

548
32:48.820 --> 32:49.140
(Over here!)

549
32:49.140 --> 32:49.860
(Pass it!)

550
32:50.620 --> 32:51.820
They're playing foot polo?

551
32:51.900 --> 32:52.820
(Pass it! Mr. Li!)

552
32:53.300 --> 32:54.620
Those little rascals!

553
32:55.060 --> 32:56.540
(Director of the Imperial Academy) They still have energy after class.

554
32:56.900 --> 32:58.340
They've got energy to spare.

555
32:59.540 --> 33:00.780
Getting more exercise

556
33:01.020 --> 33:02.460
is a good thing.

557
33:04.300 --> 33:05.660
(Liu Huaiyan, Retired Chancellor) You always see things clearly.

558
33:06.020 --> 33:06.980
In your opinion,

559
33:07.540 --> 33:09.780
are there any promising talents

560
33:10.380 --> 33:12.020
among this year's young scholars?

561
33:12.700 --> 33:13.700
I believe

562
33:14.180 --> 33:16.500
there are always promising talents.

563
33:17.340 --> 33:20.220
Whether the court can make use of them

564
33:20.660 --> 33:22.220
depends on their fortunes.

565
33:23.500 --> 33:25.860
Take Wei Shu, for example.

566
33:26.460 --> 33:27.660
Though born to a concubine,

567
33:28.020 --> 33:29.260
he has extraordinary talent.

568
33:29.980 --> 33:33.100
It's a shame he's so aloof and withdrawn.

569
33:34.660 --> 33:36.780
Then there's Feng Xianyu.

570
33:37.260 --> 33:39.540
He's Wei Shu's complete opposite.

571
33:39.900 --> 33:41.140
He's too restless and impulsive,

572
33:41.540 --> 33:43.540
so his character bears watching.

573
33:46.180 --> 33:46.740
Chancellor Liu, look.

574
33:47.900 --> 33:49.780
The student watching the game over there

575
33:50.100 --> 33:50.860
is Yan Shang.

576
33:51.420 --> 33:53.460
He's well-read and very bright.

577
33:54.260 --> 33:55.180
Yet somehow,

578
33:55.180 --> 33:57.460
he doesn't seem interested in his studies.

579
33:57.540 --> 33:57.980
(Yan Shang!)

580
33:58.260 --> 33:59.260
I wonder why.

581
34:01.260 --> 34:01.780
(Mr. Li!)

582
34:01.900 --> 34:02.340
(Yan Shang,)

583
34:02.900 --> 34:03.860
(feeling better after that rest?)

584
34:04.100 --> 34:04.820
(Ready for another round?)

585
34:05.460 --> 34:06.260
(Come on! Want to try again?)

586
34:06.260 --> 34:07.020
(Come on, Yan Shang! Try!)

587
34:07.260 --> 34:07.700
- (Let's play!) - (Come on!)

588
34:07.700 --> 34:08.220
(Come join us!)

589
34:12.420 --> 34:14.180
Come on, let's play chess.

590
34:29.820 --> 34:36.060
(Imperial Academy)

591
34:36.060 --> 34:36.780
Wei Shu, where are you going?

592
34:37.180 --> 34:37.820
Why don't we go together?

593
34:39.020 --> 34:40.180
I'm going to Princess Danyang's residence.

594
34:40.700 --> 34:42.060
Feng Xianyu, care to join me?

595
34:44.580 --> 34:44.940
Well...

596
34:45.940 --> 34:47.020
I won't keep you.

597
34:53.740 --> 35:00.730
(Virtuous and Learned)

598
35:02.420 --> 35:02.820
What's wrong?

599
35:03.900 --> 35:04.740
Where are you headed?

600
35:06.500 --> 35:07.420
To seek a recommendation.

601
35:07.580 --> 35:08.060
What about you?

602
35:09.500 --> 35:10.500
Same as you.

603
35:12.140 --> 35:13.540
(Virtuous and Learned)

604
35:13.540 --> 35:13.980
Yan Shang,

605
35:15.340 --> 35:16.780
seeking a recommendation

606
35:16.980 --> 35:18.220
is a long, hard road

607
35:19.020 --> 35:20.140
to success.

608
35:21.340 --> 35:23.380
(Imperial Academy) As the saying goes, enduring hardship

609
35:23.500 --> 35:24.420
makes you rise above the rest.

610
35:25.180 --> 35:26.220
(Mingde) Wouldn't you agree?

611
35:27.820 --> 35:28.220
Feng Xianyu,

612
35:29.020 --> 35:29.940
I've read your poems and essays.

613
35:30.660 --> 35:32.220
You're talented and hardworking.

614
35:32.860 --> 35:34.980
I'm sure you'll go far one day.

615
35:37.780 --> 35:38.820
I'll remember your kind words.

616
35:39.780 --> 35:40.620
You and Wei Shu

617
35:41.180 --> 35:42.220
(Gathering Auspice) have Princess Danyang's favor.

618
35:43.940 --> 35:45.300
You don't have the worries we do.

619
35:47.180 --> 35:47.580
Yan Shang,

620
35:49.220 --> 35:49.660
(Yizhuo Gate) I'll take my leave.

621
35:52.820 --> 35:57.100
(Gathering Auspice)

622
36:26.260 --> 36:27.420
I, Feng Xianyu,

623
36:27.860 --> 36:29.140
pay my respects to Your Highness!

624
36:32.900 --> 36:33.460
Rise.

625
36:35.620 --> 36:36.420
Thank you, Your Highness.

626
36:40.460 --> 36:41.260
Stand up.

627
36:44.420 --> 36:45.220
Let me have a look at you.

628
36:51.300 --> 36:52.060
Very good.

629
36:53.580 --> 36:54.940
You've come to the right person

630
36:55.860 --> 36:57.020
for a recommendation.

631
36:57.340 --> 37:00.220
I'd gladly play music, paint,

632
37:00.380 --> 37:01.300
and admire flowers

633
37:01.580 --> 37:03.100
with Your Highness.

634
37:03.180 --> 37:03.980
Come in.

635
37:06.660 --> 37:07.340
Feng Xianyu,

636
37:08.420 --> 37:09.780
take a good look.

637
37:11.180 --> 37:11.980
Tell me,

638
37:12.540 --> 37:14.540
which of them couldn't do what you can?

639
37:15.300 --> 37:16.460
Since you've come seeking my help,

640
37:16.900 --> 37:17.820
you may stay here, too.

641
37:18.340 --> 37:18.780
Your Highness!

642
37:19.820 --> 37:21.060
I have a wife and daughter.

643
37:21.460 --> 37:23.460
I can't be Your Highness's male favorite.

644
37:23.780 --> 37:24.820
You don't want to stay?

645
37:25.420 --> 37:26.340
Then get out!

646
37:29.420 --> 37:31.580
One day, you'll understand.

647
37:34.860 --> 37:35.300
Get out!

648
38:00.100 --> 38:00.500
Captain!

649
38:01.260 --> 38:02.700
A student wishes to see you.

650
38:03.340 --> 38:04.460
What does a student want with me?

651
38:04.580 --> 38:05.300
I can't even read.

652
38:05.820 --> 38:06.140
Send him away.

653
38:06.940 --> 38:07.380
Captain!

654
38:07.860 --> 38:09.460
He's a student at the Imperial Academy.

655
38:09.820 --> 38:11.140
He's come seeking your recommendation.

656
38:11.500 --> 38:12.100
Want a recommendation?

657
38:12.820 --> 38:13.380
From me?

658
38:17.820 --> 38:19.780
Greetings, Captain. I'm Yan Shang.

659
38:21.980 --> 38:23.060
Your name is Yan Shang?

660
38:24.860 --> 38:25.220
Yes.

661
38:36.260 --> 38:38.660
Why do you look so familiar?

662
38:39.380 --> 38:40.500
I was fortunate enough

663
38:40.980 --> 38:42.700
to meet you at Cuiyun Tower the other day.

664
39:20.980 --> 39:21.380
No, wait.

665
39:23.620 --> 39:24.380
It wasn't at Cuiyun Tower.

666
39:26.980 --> 39:28.860
I've definitely seen you before.

667
39:34.820 --> 39:36.580
You have a remarkable memory, Captain.

668
39:37.500 --> 39:39.060
At Caimei Ridge in Lingnan Circuit,

669
39:39.940 --> 39:41.420
I ran into you outside the county office.

670
39:47.060 --> 39:48.100
(Santu County Office)

671
39:49.300 --> 39:51.300
(Santu County Office)

672
40:07.660 --> 40:08.220
Now I remember!

673
40:10.020 --> 40:10.500
That's where I've seen you!

674
40:12.700 --> 40:14.100
I've long admired you, Captain.

675
40:16.380 --> 40:17.060
What a coincidence.

676
40:17.940 --> 40:19.620
I ran into you again at Cuiyun Tower.

677
40:20.180 --> 40:21.300
Because of you,

678
40:21.860 --> 40:23.460
Xu Mianmian, that little hussy,

679
40:23.460 --> 40:25.140
got away from me!

680
40:26.500 --> 40:27.140
Please calm down, Captain.

681
40:27.780 --> 40:29.580
I got carried away that day

682
40:30.340 --> 40:31.700
and approached you without thinking.

683
40:32.660 --> 40:34.660
I didn't mean to spoil your fun.

684
40:38.220 --> 40:39.540
At least you've got good taste.

685
40:41.060 --> 40:42.340
I'll remember you from now on.

686
40:43.260 --> 40:44.540
You're seeking a recommendation, right?

687
40:45.260 --> 40:46.100
Let me see your work.

688
40:49.340 --> 40:50.180
Please give me your guidance.

689
40:58.140 --> 41:01.260
(Am I supposed to critique it, too?)

690
41:03.340 --> 41:05.140
(Content of the Essay) (Where does it begin?)

691
41:05.500 --> 41:07.540
(Content of the Essay) (Where does it end?)

692
41:16.940 --> 41:19.220
My knowledge is limited, and my writing is poor.

693
41:19.540 --> 41:20.060
I'm afraid

694
41:20.860 --> 41:21.900
it won't meet your standards.

695
41:24.020 --> 41:25.180
It's not very good.

696
41:25.580 --> 41:26.340
And you expect me

697
41:26.700 --> 41:28.700
to recommend this to Lord Yu?

698
41:29.020 --> 41:30.220
I'd be a laughingstock!

699
41:31.460 --> 41:32.300
I'm deeply ashamed.

700
41:33.180 --> 41:34.780
Your critique alone is an honor.

701
41:35.980 --> 41:37.780
I wouldn't dare presume to meet Lord Yu.

702
41:38.860 --> 41:39.940
(Forget you, boy.)

703
41:40.860 --> 41:43.340
(Even I can barely get an audience with Lord Yu.)

704
41:44.980 --> 41:45.900
A recommendation

705
41:46.820 --> 41:47.820
isn't out of the question.

706
41:49.580 --> 41:50.700
How much are you willing to pay?

707
41:54.020 --> 41:54.980
I'm ashamed to say it,

708
41:55.940 --> 41:57.660
but I'm short on money.

709
41:59.580 --> 41:59.900
However,

710
42:00.700 --> 42:02.140
if there's anything else you need,

711
42:02.740 --> 42:04.740
I'll gladly do my best to help!

712
42:09.420 --> 42:11.540
But now that you're in Sheng'an,

713
42:11.940 --> 42:13.540
you can get whatever you want.

714
42:14.460 --> 42:16.380
Even if I wanted to be of use,

715
42:16.940 --> 42:17.460
I'm afraid

716
42:18.220 --> 42:19.500
I'm not even fit to tie your boots.

717
42:22.060 --> 42:23.740
With those skinny arms and legs,

718
42:23.740 --> 42:24.860
what could you possibly do for me?

719
42:25.860 --> 42:27.980
Well, I do have a problem.

720
42:29.180 --> 42:29.820
Xu Mianmian

721
42:30.380 --> 42:31.260
at Cuiyun Tower

722
42:32.420 --> 42:33.380
doesn't know what's good for her.

723
42:34.540 --> 42:35.660
She refuses to serve me.

724
42:36.100 --> 42:38.060
Get her to give in,

725
42:38.180 --> 42:40.060
and I'll reward you handsomely.

726
42:43.660 --> 42:44.820
Captain, you're tough as iron.

727
42:45.460 --> 42:46.860
You may not understand women.

728
42:47.740 --> 42:49.700
Kindness works better than force.

729
42:50.420 --> 42:51.700
Give me a few days.

730
42:52.340 --> 42:54.460
I'll take care of it.

731
43:00.780 --> 43:02.060
You'd better.

732
43:03.860 --> 43:04.500
You scholars...

733
43:05.220 --> 43:05.780
You're always

734
43:06.380 --> 43:07.100
full of clever tricks.

735
43:08.700 --> 43:10.300
Pull this off,

736
43:11.660 --> 43:13.500
and I'll make you the top scholar!

737
43:18.180 --> 43:18.860
Leave it to me.

738
43:19.300 --> 43:20.100
Just wait for my word.

739
43:53.780 --> 43:56.620
(Zhang Renjing)

740
44:00.100 --> 44:02.740
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

741
44:22.380 --> 44:27.100
(Next Episode Preview)

742
44:27.700 --> 44:29.700
The Peony Goddess at Sigui Garden

743
44:29.980 --> 44:31.860
is said to grant prayers for children.

744
44:32.420 --> 44:34.020
The Peony Festival is tomorrow.

745
44:34.820 --> 44:35.900
Why not come with me?

746
44:36.460 --> 44:37.420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

747
44:37.580 --> 44:38.820
The festival will be crowded.

748
44:39.140 --> 44:39.860
I'm not used to crowds.

749
44:43.441 --> 44:46.734
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

750
44:49.419 --> 44:54.335
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

751
44:56.529 --> 45:02.374
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

752
45:02.874 --> 45:08.100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

753
45:10.869 --> 45:15.660
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

754
45:16.496 --> 45:22.575
♪Through trails of mud and blood; let grief drown in your eyes♪

755
45:24.376 --> 45:27.526
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

756
45:27.526 --> 45:29.174
♪Burning bright as a song♪

757
45:29.226 --> 45:32.950
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

758
45:33.328 --> 45:37.994
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

759
45:38.613 --> 45:42.654
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

760
45:43.145 --> 45:45.260
♪Not a single hour less♪

761
45:45.300 --> 45:52.246
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

762
45:53.009 --> 45:56.462
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

763
45:56.642 --> 45:59.787
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

764
46:00.226 --> 46:06.863
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

765
46:07.260 --> 46:11.774
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

766
46:11.812 --> 46:14.281
♪You're the only one I need♪

767
46:14.485 --> 46:21.372
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

768
46:21.684 --> 46:24.955
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

769
46:25.260 --> 46:28.433
♪My last untouched innocence♪

770
46:28.757 --> 46:32.183
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

771
46:32.416 --> 46:35.641
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

772
46:35.972 --> 46:42.768
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

773
46:43.137 --> 46:47.703
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

774
46:47.750 --> 46:50.088
♪You're the only one I need♪

775
46:50.319 --> 46:57.154
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

776
46:57.503 --> 46:59.121
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

777
46:59.251 --> 47:01.047
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

778
47:01.404 --> 47:04.421
♪You're the only one I need♪

779
47:04.461 --> 47:05.788
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
